ENGINE NOTE: The compiled JavaScript engine bundled at src/engine/calc.js and
src/engine/report.js originates from the closed-source Mythsensus TypeScript
source code (planned for open-source publication Q3-Q4 2026 alongside the v2
engine release). The compiled engine code is what mythsensus.com serves to
every browser visitor and is therefore already publicly available; bundling
it here adds no incremental disclosure. This MCP wrapper code (everything in
src/index.ts and src/tools/) is fully MIT-licensed; the bundled compiled
engine is subject to the same MIT terms for use in this MCP package only.
